step Fly to the Undercity
  only Warrior,Paladin,Rogue,Priest,Mage,Warlock
  zone Badlands
  tip Your level 40 training is in the Undercity: fly there from Kargath, train, and take the zeppelin from the towers outside the city to Grom'gol.
  zone Undercity
  zone Badlands
  fly "Undercity"

step Riding at 40
  only Undead,Warrior,Paladin,Rogue,Priest,Mage
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  when level>=40
  tip Riding needs level 40 and costs 100 gold; learning it gives you a mount. Each race learns it from its own race's trainer: yours is Velma Warnam in Brill, a short ride north of the zeppelin towers, with Zachariah Post's skeletal horses (20 gold each) beside her.
  train 4773 optional                   -- Velma Warnam, riding trainer
  note "Skeletal horses: Zachariah Post, beside Velma Warnam in Brill."

