step Riding at 40
  only Undead,!Warlock
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  when level>=40
  when !skill Riding 1
  tip Riding needs level 40 and costs 100 gold; learning it gives you a mount, and the Riverglades after Stranglethorn are a long walk without one. Take the zeppelin from Grom'gol's tower to the Undercity's towers: Velma Warnam teaches the Forsaken in Brill, a short ride north, with Zachariah Post's skeletal horses (20 gold each). Then the zeppelin back to Grom'gol. Short of gold? Skip this step: the Swamp of Sorrows guide passes the Undercity again at about 47.
  train 4773                            -- Velma Warnam, riding trainer

step Your mount at 40
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  only Warlock
  when level>=40
  tip Warlocks don't buy riding: your mount is the Felsteed, from your class quest. Zevrost in Orgrimmar's Cleft of Shadow starts it and Strahad Farsan in Ratchet teaches it, both on the Feralas guide's Orgrimmar stop at about 45.
  note "Felsteed: Zevrost in Orgrimmar, then Strahad Farsan in Ratchet, on the Feralas guide's Orgrimmar stop."

