step The Bloodsail ships
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  when group 624
  tip The scroll, Cortello's Riddle, lies on the decks of the three ships off the Wild Shore, crewed by pirates of 42-45 who come in pairs, with captains of 45-48: take it with a group. Its chain runs on through the Swamp of Sorrows, Dustwallow Marsh and the Hinterlands.
  collect 4056 "Cortello's Riddle"    -- Inside
  accept 624                            -- for a later stop in the Swamp of Sorrows

step Zul'Mamwe
  tip Head north to the Skullsplitter ruins east of the Venture Co. mine; pull the headhunters and berserkers one at a time. One pile of trophy skulls stands on the ruins' north side. Every Skullsplitter can drop a tusk or a necklace: the necklaces are the slow part, so keep killing in the warriors' camp north of the ruins until you have them all. Careful: Ana'thek the Cruel (45) walks the south-western ruins with two guards; Speaking with Gan'zulah's last piece, his Broken Armor, waits for your Stranglethorn stop at about 45.
  collect 1524 quest 209.1 @45.4,36.2 map 1434 era only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead
  collect 3908 quest 585.3 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead

